    <briefdescription>
<para>Class storing the complete set of values that are observed by DbgValues within the current function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Allows 2-way lookup, with <computeroutput>find</computeroutput> returning the <ref refid="namespacellvm_1ab471937b9a227e70c7fe8bd9604014d6" kindref="member">Op</ref> for a given <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> and <computeroutput>insert</computeroutput> returning the <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> for a given <ref refid="namespacellvm_1ab471937b9a227e70c7fe8bd9604014d6" kindref="member">Op</ref> (creating one if none exists). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
